<title>NIGERIA: Nigerias weekly forex demand drops to $70.76 mln.</title>
<headline>Nigerias weekly forex demand drops to $70.76 mln.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nigerias Central Bank said on Friday it sold $70.76 million at a rate of 80 to the dollar at its weekly auction this week.</p>
<p>Last week, the bank sold $90.36 million at the same rate.</p>
<p>It did not give reasons for the drop in demand, but bankers attributed it to moderation of excess liquidity.</p>
<p>--Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
